  "prompt_en": "Professional food photography of classic skillet chicken and rice, featuring juicy golden-brown chicken pieces nestled among perfectly cooked grains of seasoned rice, garnished with translucent sautéed onions. Served in a rustic ceramic bowl on a dark wooden table. Soft natural window light highlighting the textures and steam rising gently from the dish. 45-degree angle composition, shallow depth of field, warm cozy home kitchen ambiance. No text, no logos, no people, no unrelated elements.",
